      "message": "[error] Line 1586: 🔴 `ExternalMediaDemotionAccepted` is emitted while `callMutex_` is held (`reportExternalRemoteAnswer` keeps the lock for the whole function). `emitSignal` is synchronous, so a client callback that calls back into call APIs (e.g. completion/cancel/hangup/state queries) can re-enter and block on `callMutex_`, deadlocking the call thread. Capture the request/SDP under lock, release `callMutex_`, then emit the signal outside the critical section (same pattern already used for promotion ready/failure reporting).",
