      "message": "[error] Line 179: 🔴 `failDemotion()` emits `ExternalMediaDemotionFailure` while still on callers\u0027 lock context (many call sites invoke it under `callMutex_`, e.g. `hangup`, `removeCall`, `onInviteTransactionTerminated`). Because signal dispatch is synchronous, callback re-entry into call methods can deadlock on `callMutex_`. Refactor `failDemotion` to only extract/reset demotion state under lock and return `(requestId, reason)` for reporting after unlocking, mirroring the promotion `take* + report*` split.",
